#: core/Mcp/Requirements.php:329
msgid "Use discovered requirement identifiers."
msgstr "Gunakan pengidentifikasi persyaratan yang ditemukan."

#: core/Mcp/Requirements.php:350
msgid "Settings changed. Read them again."
msgstr "Pengaturan telah diubah. Bacalah lagi."

#: core/Mcp/Settings.php:47
msgid "Enable User Roles Filter (Who can ignore)"
msgstr "Aktifkan Penyaring Peran Pengguna (Siapa yang bisa mengabaikan)"

#: core/Mcp/Settings.php:48
msgid "Show warning icon"
msgstr "Tampilkan ikon peringatan"

#: core/Mcp/Settings.php:49
msgid "Highlight failing blocks in the editor"
msgstr "Sorot blok yang gagal di editor"

#: core/Mcp/Settings.php:50
msgid "Disable the Status option when using Quick Edit"
msgstr "Nonaktifkan opsi Status saat menggunakan Edit Cepat"

#: core/Mcp/Settings.php:51
msgid "Disable Quick Edit completely"
msgstr "Nonaktifkan Edit Cepat sepenuhnya"

#: core/Mcp/Settings.php:52
msgid "Disable Publish button"
msgstr "Nonaktifkan tombol Terbitkan"

#: core/Mcp/Settings.php:53
msgid "Rename task labels"
msgstr "Ganti nama label tugas"

#: core/Mcp/Settings.php:54
msgid "Checklist task sort order"
msgstr "Urutan sortir tugas checklist"

#: core/Mcp/Settings.php:69
msgid "Read Checklists settings"
msgstr "Baca pengaturan Checklist"

#: core/Mcp/Settings.php:70
msgid ""
"Read Post Types, General, Publishing Options and Appearance settings with "
"exact native fields, choices and revisions. Actual Pro adds available "
"non-secret settings. OpenAI/license credentials are excluded. Requires "
"manage_options."
msgstr ""
"Baca Jenis Pos, Umum, Opsi Penerbitan, dan pengaturan Penampilan dengan "
"bidang, pilihan, dan revisi asli yang tepat. Pro aktual menambah pengaturan "
"non-rahasia yang tersedia. Kredensial OpenAI/izin dikecualikan. Memerlukan "
"manage_options."

#: core/Mcp/Settings.php:78
msgid "Update Checklists settings"
msgstr "Perbarui pengaturan Checklist"

#: core/Mcp/Settings.php:79
msgid ""
"Patch supplied discovered settings using the latest hash. Boolean inputs "
"map to native yes/no or on/off storage; post_types is a list of enabled "
"names. Preserves omitted settings and credentials. dry_run previews native "
"validation without saving. Feature-specific settings retain dependency and "
"edition gates."
msgstr ""
"Patch pengaturan yang ditemukan yang disuplai menggunakan hash terbaru. "
"Input boolean dipetakan ke penyimpanan ya/tidak asli atau hidup/mati; "
"post_types adalah daftar nama yang diaktifkan. Mempertahankan pengaturan "
"dan kredensial yang diabaikan. dry_run melihat validasi asli tanpa "
"menyimpan. Pengaturan spesifik fitur mempertahankan ketergantungan dan "
"gerbang edisi."

#: core/Mcp/Settings.php:89
msgid "Enable an optional Checklists feature"
msgstr "Aktifkan fitur Checklist opsional"

#: core/Mcp/Settings.php:90
msgid ""
"Enable or disable one discovered optional module. Core/autoloaded modules "
"cannot be disabled. Requires manage_options and actual module availability. "
"Uses the latest feature inventory hash. Changes take effect in a fresh "
"request."
msgstr ""
"Aktifkan atau nonaktifkan satu modul opsional yang ditemukan. Modul "
"inti/dimuat otomatis tidak dapat dinonaktifkan. Memerlukan manage_options "
"dan ketersediaan modul yang sebenarnya. Menggunakan hash inventaris fitur "
"terbaru. Perubahan berlaku dalam permintaan baru."

#: core/Mcp/Settings.php:129
msgid "Settings changed. Read them again before saving."
msgstr "Pengaturan telah diubah. Bacalah lagi sebelum menyimpan."

#: core/Mcp/Settings.php:139
msgid "This setting requires its active integration."
msgstr "Pengaturan ini memerlukan integrasi aktifnya."

#: core/Mcp/Settings.php:170
msgid "Native validation did not accept this setting."
msgstr "Validasi asli tidak menerima pengaturan ini."

#: core/Mcp/Settings.php:192
msgid "Feature settings changed. Discover them again."
msgstr "Pengaturan fitur telah diubah. Temukan mereka lagi."

#: core/Mcp/Settings.php:200
msgid "This core module cannot be switched through MCP."
msgstr "Modul inti ini tidak dapat dialihkan melalui MCP."

#: core/Mcp/Settings.php:210
msgid "Choose an available feature from discovery."
msgstr "Pilih fitur yang tersedia dari penemuan."

#: core/Mcp/Tasks.php:38
msgid "Read a post checklist"
msgstr "Baca checklist pos"

#: core/Mcp/Tasks.php:39
msgid ""
"Read the native checklist for an editable saved post, respecting ignored "
"roles and active Pro status/taxonomy exclusions. Results are native server "
"snapshots, not a guarantee about unsaved editor content or JavaScript-only "
"checks. OpenAI calls are not performed. Includes manual completion "
"permissions and current revision."
msgstr ""
"Baca checklist asli untuk pos yang dapat diedit, menghormati peran yang "
"diabaikan dan pengecualian status/taxonomy Pro yang aktif. Hasilnya adalah "
"snapshot server asli, bukan jaminan tentang konten editor yang tidak "
"disimpan atau pemeriksaan hanya JavaScript. Panggilan OpenAI tidak "
"dilakukan. Termasuk izin penyelesaian manual dan revisi saat ini."

#: core/Mcp/Tasks.php:47
msgid "Complete or reopen manual checklist tasks"
msgstr "Selesaikan atau buka kembali tugas checklist manual"

#: core/Mcp/Tasks.php:48
msgid ""
"Set explicit boolean states for configured, enabled custom checkboxes or "
"approvals on one editable post using its latest revision. Checks each "
"task's native role/user restrictions and post-meta permission before any "
"write. Automatic and OpenAI results cannot be forged. dry_run validates "
"without saving."
msgstr ""
"Tetapkan status boolean eksplisit untuk kotak centang kustom yang telah "
"dikonfigurasi dan diaktifkan atau persetujuan pada satu pos yang dapat "
"diedit menggunakan revisi terbarunya. Memeriksa pembatasan peran/pengguna "
"asli setiap tugas dan izin post-meta sebelum menulis. Hasil otomatis dan "
"OpenAI tidak dapat dipalsukan. dry_run memvalidasi tanpa menyimpan."

#: core/Mcp/Tasks.php:87
msgid "The post or checklist changed. Read it again."
msgstr "Pos atau checklist telah diubah. Bacalah lagi."

#: core/Mcp/Tasks.php:93
msgid "You cannot mark this task for this post."
msgstr "Anda tidak dapat menandai tugas ini untuk pos ini."

#: core/Mcp/Tasks.php:131
msgid "Task state could not be saved; original states were restored."
msgstr "Status tugas tidak dapat disimpan; status asli telah dipulihkan."

#: core/Mcp/Tasks.php:132
msgid ""
"Task state save failed and recovery was incomplete. Read the checklist "
"before retrying."
msgstr ""
"Penyimpanan status tugas gagal dan pemulihan tidak lengkap. Bacalah daftar "
"periksa sebelum mencoba lagi."

#: core/Plugin.php:84
#: modules/settings/settings.php:137
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan"

#: core/Plugin.php:92
#: publishpress-checklists.php:193
